Accounts ai data and privacy limits
title end

paragraph start
Never enter passwords, recovery codes, two factor codes, session tokens, card numbers or private data of followers into any AI tool.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Read the terms of each tool and record what they say about data use, with the date read.
paragraph end

